## High-Level Architecture

### Routing baru
```
/client/hardware-requests            → UserHardwareListPage (own requests)
/client/hardware-requests/new        → UserHardwareSubmitPage (form ringan)
/client/hardware-requests/:id        → UserHardwareDetailPage (read-only + cancel)

/manager/hardware-requests           → IctHardwareDashboard (full kanban + tabel)
/manager/hardware-requests/:id       → IctHardwareControlCenter (panel aksi penuh)
/manager/hardware-requests/calendar  → IctInstallationCalendar (jadwal pemasangan)
```

Routing `BentoLayout` (`/hardware-requests`) di-redirect ke `/manager/hardware-requests` (legacy URL backwards-compat).

### Role guard
- `/client/hardware-requests/*` → semua user yang punya `pageAccess.hardware_requests = true`.
- `/manager/hardware-requests/*` → role `MANAGER`, `AGENT`, `AGENT_*`, `ADMIN` (alias "ICT").
- Backend: helper `isIctRole(user)` di `apps/backend/src/modules/auth/utils/roles.util.ts` (NEW), dipakai di semua endpoint sensitif.

