## UI/UX Design Direction (akan dipoles dengan `frontend-design` skill di phase implementasi)

### Theme
- Pertahankan HSL CSS variables existing (`--primary`, `--card`, dst).
- **Industrial/Utilitarian** vibe (Slate base + Amber accent) — sudah konsisten dengan walkthrough doc.
- Spacing generous: `gap-6`, `p-7`, `rounded-2xl`/`rounded-3xl`.
- Typography: heading `font-extrabold tracking-tighter uppercase`, label `font-bold tracking-widest text-[10px] uppercase`.

### User Portal (ringan, friendly)
- **Submit form**: single page, conversational. Field: judul + tipe + items (repeater) + urgency (Low/Normal/High pill selector) + alasan + checkbox "butuh dibantu instalasi".
- **List page**: card grid responsif, status badge prominent, hover lift animation.
- **Detail page**: hero summary di atas + status pipeline animated + timeline. Tombol "Cancel Request" hanya jika status PENDING.
- **Empty state**: ilustrasi friendly + CTA besar "Ajukan Request Pertama".

### ICT Control Center
- **Dashboard**: toggle Kanban/Table. Kanban 6 kolom, card draggable optional (dnd-kit). Counts badge per kolom.
- **Filter strip**: search, urgency, requester dept, date range, status.
- **Bulk actions**: di table view, select multiple → approve/reject batch.
- **Detail / Control Center**:
  - Layout 12-grid: kiri 7 kolom (info+items+timeline), kanan 5 kolom (sticky `ActionDock`).
  - `ActionDock` kontekstual:
    - PENDING → Approve / Reject form
    - APPROVED → Start Purchasing button + form vendor/budget
    - PURCHASING → Mark Arrived (per item checklist)
    - PARTIALLY_ARRIVED / ARRIVED → Schedule Installation (inline) + Realize (PO+Invoice form)
    - REALIZED → Read-only summary
  - Setiap aksi punya optimistic update + toast.
- **Calendar**: minggu view, drag schedule antar slot ICT. Slot fix: `08:00-12:00`, `13:00-17:00` (sesuai existing).

### Animations (using `framer-motion` jika belum ada, atau CSS transition)
- Page transition: fade-in + slide-up subtle.
- Kanban card: spring drag animation.
- Status pipeline: stagger node fill saat status berubah.
- Form repeater: smooth height transition saat add/remove item.
- Modal: backdrop blur + scale in.
- Notification toast: slide from top-right.
- Empty state: subtle floating ilustrasi.

### Accessibility
- Semua tombol punya `aria-label`.
- Form field punya `<label>` + `aria-describedby` untuk error.
- Kanban: keyboard navigation (arrow keys + space to drag).
- Color contrast WCAG AA minimum.

