   - Login → `/manager/hardware-requests` → kanban menampilkan card baru di kolom PENDING.
   - Klik card → control center → klik Approve di ActionDock → modal konfirmasi note → status pindah ke APPROVED, ActionDock berubah jadi "Start Purchasing".
   - Klik Start Purchasing → input vendor + estimasi → status PURCHASING.
   - Klik Mark Arrived → checklist 2 item → centang 1 → status PARTIALLY_ARRIVED. Centang sisanya → ARRIVED.
   - Inline scheduler muncul → pilih slot → status di item: scheduled.
   - Klik Realize → input PO + Invoice + upload attachment → status REALIZED.
3. **As USER (kembali)**:
   - Refresh detail → timeline lengkap, status REALIZED, tombol cancel hilang, info instalasi visible.

